&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Maneuver Dominance team at Anduril develops operationally relevant, multi-asset autonomy. We are focused on making large groups of autonomous systems work effectively together. We leverage existing Anduril drone platforms like Ghost or Altius, in addition to bringing 3rd party platforms into Anduril’s Lattice ecosystem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a Frontend Software Engineer to join our rapidly growing team in London. In this role, you will be responsible for developing custom, map-based UI/UX for autonomous system command and control. You will work with customers to understand their requirements, design bespoke user interfaces with excellent user experiences. If you are someone who possess a “Whatever It Takes” mindset—executing in an expedient, scalable, and pragmatic way while keeping the mission top-of-mind and making sound engineering decisions then this role is for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with pilots and other drone users to understand how to design UX’s to reduce cognitive burden while still ensuring safety of flight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and deploy a real-time, map-based interface for displaying and interacting with sensor data and commanding physical assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fetch and manage large streams of data while maintaining performant rendering in a low-friction user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and design immersive image-viewing experiences on multiple platforms, including web-based and mobile 3D image viewing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with end-users to turn needs into features while balancing user experience with engineering constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CORE REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Operations Research, Electrical Engineering or related technical degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on frontend applications, especially data-intensive or map-based systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of professional experience using Javascript, Typescript, React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad experience in delivering functional outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset towards innovative approaches of problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to travel up to 25%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DESIRED REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background with focus in Physics, Mathematics, and/or Motion Planning to inform modeling &amp;amp; simulation (M&amp;amp;S) and physical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and testing UI/UX for multi-agent autonomous systems and deploying in real-world environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feature and algorithm development with an understanding of behavior trees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing software for flight systems and safety critical functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distributed communication networks and message standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£75,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£100,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an ----- address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is ----- before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Deliveroo?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building the definitive online food company, transforming the way the world eats by making hyper-local food more convenient and accessible. We&#39;re at the forefront of an industry, powered by our market-leading technology and unrivalled network to bring incredible convenience and selection to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Deliveroo is the perfect environment to build a definitive career, motivated by impact on your own development, on Deliveroo as we scale, and on the marketplace and communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer Ordering Experience&lt;/strong&gt; owns the core purchase journey: the store page, item page, basket, and checkout flow, across both app and web. It&#39;s a global team — the surfaces we build support all of our brands: Deliveroo, Wolt, and Doordash. You&#39;d be the team&#39;s first dedicated web/full-stack engineer, helping us build out our web experience from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve the store, item, basket, and checkout experiences on web, working primarily in React and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to backend services written in Golang — deep Go experience isn&#39;t a hard requirement, but you should be comfortable picking up a new statically typed backend language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve code structure, shape architecture, and review code across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with your Product Manager and fellow engineers to scope and ship changes to the ordering funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in the hiring process and support the growth of your teammates as the team scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full-stack experience — comfortable working across web frontend (React/TypeScript) and backend (Go, or similar) to unblock delivery end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, implementing and rolling out A/B experiments (or strong aptitude to quickly learn our experimentation platform) — including guardrail metrics, staged rollouts and reading results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-moving, ambiguous environment with shifting priorities and short XP cycles (weeks, not quarters)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mindset — able to take a brief PRD through design, implementation, rollout and production monitoring with minimal hand-holding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping incrementally and iterating on data rather than big-bang launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to participate in an on-call rotation and respond to incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating engineers across multiple platforms (iOS/Android/Web/BE) on a single initiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active use of AI-assisted coding workflows, and interest in building reusable tooling/skills for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone &lt;strong&gt;London-based&lt;/strong&gt; who can work &lt;strong&gt;from our office 2–3 days a week&lt;/strong&gt; alongside the rest of the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community organisers, proud parents, and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our&lt;a href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering&quot;&gt; Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Explore our&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/interview-guide-for-engineers/&quot;&gt; Engineering Interview Guide here&lt;/a&gt; to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo will process your personal information in accordance with our&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join one of Catawiki’s main Development Verticals, &lt;strong&gt;Demand&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Supply&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Fulfilment&lt;/strong&gt;, and help us improve the experience of buyers, sellers, and internal teams across our platform. Working alongside Backend, Frontend, iOS, and Android Engineers, you’ll build product innovations for Catawiki’s apps and web app.&lt;br&gt;You’ll collaborate closely with QA, UX Designers, Product Managers, and with the support of a Tech Lead Manager to create beautiful, adaptable web frontends on top of scalable microservices. While your product area may vary, your goal will remain the same: deliver reliable, high-quality experiences that make a meaningful impact for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Catawiki, you will make an impact by improving and delivering product innovations for the Catawiki platform:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Build impactful product experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; by improving and delivering innovations across the Catawiki platform for buyers, sellers, customer service, and internal operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Create adaptable web frontends&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; on top of scalable microservices using our core frontend stack of TypeScript and ReactJS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Deliver responsive, accessible experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; that work well across desktop, tablet, and mobile screens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Optimise product performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; by measuring and monitoring systems and using insights to improve the experiences you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Experiment and learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; by partnering with Product Managers and UX Designers on A/B tests, using data analysis to validate ideas and iterate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Collaborate across disciplines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; with engineers, QA, design, and product colleagues to build scalable and maintainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a &lt;em&gt;Frontend Engineer&lt;/em&gt; with extensive frontend experience in multiple technologies, with an impressive portfolio of past frontend deliveries, and eager to expand your knowledge and impact, ready to take the next step in your career. As a Senior Developer, you are effective in lifting the level of your team, and you love to cooperate with Frontend Engineers of other teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Extensive frontend experience&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Demonstrated experience as a Frontend Engineer, using JavaScript or TypeScript as your main stack, with a strong portfolio of frontend deliveries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Strong web foundations&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Proficiency in JavaScript/TypeScript, HTML, and CSS, along with an understanding of HTTP/S, the Critical Rendering Path, CORS, caching, and CDNs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Modern frontend expertise&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Familiarity with libraries and frameworks such as ReactJS, NextJS, Redux, CSS Modules, Tailwind, and/or Rails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Product-focused collaboration&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Proven experience in product companies, working closely with engineers and Product Managers as part of an autonomous, cross-functional team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Production ownership&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; Experience designing, implementing, deploying, monitoring, and managing applications with a focus on availability, latency, and consistency - you build it, you run it, you love it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Quality-minded engineering&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; An understanding of principles such as SOLID and DRY, with consideration for accessibility, security, SEO, performance, testing, observability, internationalisation, and typing when building features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Collaborate and grow with your team&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; You take initiative, welcome new challenges, help raise the level of your team, share knowledge across teams, and actively expand your skills and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Experiment, learn, and iterate&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; You validate ideas quickly, iterate based on insights, and are willing to discard what does not work - then build validated solutions for long-term scalability and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;NodeJS&lt;/strong&gt; and experience running it in production is a plus. It will help you collaborate effectively across the stack and optimise frontend-backend interactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Engineering teams are interdisciplinary, bringing together Backend, Frontend, iOS, and Android Engineers with QA, UX Design, Product Management, and Engineering leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Teams take ownership of their product area and work together to ship new features, learn new things, and pursue meaningful technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;We use a test-and-learn approach, combining experimentation and data with a focus on maintainability and long-term quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We value passionate engineers who have a strong eye for detail, take initiative, support their colleagues, and enjoy working in a diverse and dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You&#39;ll Be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role based in Amsterdam.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;You will work from our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam HQ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are only considering candidates who are already based in&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;the &lt;strong&gt;Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;relocation support is not available for this position&lt;/span&gt;. We can, however, &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;provide visa transfer from current Dutch employer&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;800+ Catawikians&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/span&gt; depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work From Home Allowance&lt;/span&gt; to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commuting&lt;/span&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Office&lt;/span&gt; right in the centre of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Build and own a self-service, multi-tenant platform that keeps the critical data of 20+ customers recoverable&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you like building platforms that other teams consume, at scale, across private and public clouds, with security and tenant isolation as non-negotiables? At Schuberg Philis, the world is shifting from traditional backup to data security and resilience. We’re looking for a Platform Engineer to strengthen our Data Management-as-a-Service (DMS) team and help us build the next generation of our platform.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;About the Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The DMS team builds and runs a shared, fully segregated data resilience platform that serves more than 20 of our customers. Customer teams consume it through self-service, and they handle their own day-to-day backup and restore operations. That means you won’t spend your days on job monitoring, restore tickets or backup schedules. Your customers are internal and external engineering teams, and your product is the platform they build on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll join a dedicated group of data security experts within our larger Services Team and work closely with our sbp.cloud team, who operate our self-built sovereign cloud solutions. With our plan-build-run approach, you take end-to-end ownership: you design it, you build it, you run it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Challenge&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Running one platform for 20+ customers means solving the hard problems of platform engineering:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-tenancy by design: strict isolation of data, access, and performance between customers, on shared infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-service at scale: APIs, guardrails and automation that let customer teams onboard and operate independently, without tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale and resilience: 4,000+ protected endpoints and more than 25,000 recovery points generated daily, on a dedicated private cloud spanning multiple availability zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heterogeneous workloads: Oracle, MS-SQL, SAP, Sybase, PaaS, container platforms and VMs across VMware VCF, OpenStack, AWS, Azure and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern storage back-ends: public cloud services and S3-compatible object storage built on Pure FlashBlade//S and NetApp StorageGRID in our own datacenters, plus a long-term archiving tier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security first: immutability, segregation and hardening in a highly secure environment where recoverability is the ultimate guarantee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Platform Engineer, you take full responsibility for the lifecycle of the platform: architecture, deployment, evolution and reliability. You treat the platform as a product: you improve features, drive innovation and keep the user experience of customer teams in mind. You work closely with technology vendors (primarily Commvault) and push their product teams to improve, while applying standardized guardrails, driving automation and following best-in-class practices.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your focus is on making day-2 operations simple and cost-effective, so there is room to implement new security features, streamline customer onboarding and enable new projects. You also guide customers in their data protection needs, contribute to RFIs/RFPs, and help scope and design new solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture and lifecycle of a multi-tenant data resilience platform, in line with our plan-build-run methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship self-service capabilities that customer teams use independently, end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate everything repeatable: deployments, tenant onboarding, configuration and platform operations, using Infrastructure as Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure platform availability, aiming for 100% uptime and maximum customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve a diverse storage back-end across public cloud and on-prem S3-compatible solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable customers to protect workloads on VMware VCF, OpenStack, AWS, Azure, Kubernetes and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with vendor product teams and drive their roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on advisory and technical support, contribute to RFI/RFP processes, and help design new solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who Are You?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First and foremost, you are a platform engineer at heart, and you like building things other engineers rely on. A passion for data protection, security and resilience is a plus, and you’ll grow it here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy teamwork, thrive on challenges and like collaborating with both peers and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable in highly secure, complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a solid understanding of multi-tenant architectures and security concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Linux and/or Windows ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience across private (VMware/OpenStack) and public cloud platforms (Azure, AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re skilled in Infrastructure as Code (Terraform, Ansible and/or Chef) and in scripting and automation (Python, Bash, PowerShell, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data management/protection tools is valuable, whether Commvault, Rubrik or similar, but not a must. We’ll teach you the domain; you bring the engineering craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More information?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do not hesitate to call Maggie: 06 23 75 70 86.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Only application submitted through the website will be considered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, our Platform Horizontal has evolved from solely managing the cloud into a broad function supporting Reliability, Developer Experience, Security, and Quality. We take a holistic approach to creating systems and tools that help developers deliver applications seamlessly and reliably without getting bogged down in infrastructure complexity.&lt;br&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Platform Engineer&lt;/em&gt;, you’ll work at the intersection of development, infrastructure, and operations. You’ll help shape and execute our long-term platform vision, empowering Catawiki teams to deliver value to customers with speed, reliability, and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll build and improve the platform capabilities that enable our engineering teams to develop, deploy, and operate applications effectively at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a self-service developer platform&lt;/strong&gt; with a particular emphasis on developer experience, designing and maintaining platforms that abstract complexity and give teams the tools to deploy, monitor, and optimise their applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate cloud-native infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, manage Kubernetes clusters and other cloud resources, focusing on performance, scalability, and cost efficiency through FinOps practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boost developer productivity&lt;/strong&gt; by building and enhancing CI/CD pipelines, GitOps workflows, and reusable templates that accelerate development and deployment cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive reliability and scalability&lt;/strong&gt; through applying practices for fault tolerance, disaster recovery, and scaling so applications run smoothly under changing conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve platform operations&lt;/strong&gt; usage and enhance our observability stack to monitor platform health and resolve incidents proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate and innovate&lt;/strong&gt; by partnering with product teams to understand their needs, build simple and impactful solutions, and champion cloud-native best practices across Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You measure what matters, introduce changes gradually, and treat failure as a normal part of learning. You use tooling and automation wherever possible to reduce toil, and enjoy sharing knowledge with others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cloud-native expertise&lt;/span&gt;: At least 5 years of production experience with Kubernetes, container orchestration, and cloud platforms such as GCP, AWS, or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Automation mindset&lt;/span&gt;: Experience automating workflows and CI/CD pipelines and working with infrastructure-as-code tools such as Terraform or Ansible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Observability experience&lt;/span&gt;: Hands-on experience using and maintaining tools such as Prometheus, Grafana, ELK, or OpenTelemetry to improve reliability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Strong ownership&lt;/span&gt;: You proactively address platform issues and work toward long-term scalability and resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative approach: You work effectively with developers and cross-functional teams to align goals and deliver impactful yet simple solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous learning&lt;/span&gt;: You keep developing your knowledge of cloud-native tools, technologies, and practices in a fast-moving ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Horizontal supports engineering teams across Catawiki by reducing infrastructure complexity and providing reliable, secure, and scalable foundations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We collaborate closely with product teams to understand their challenges and improve their development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We favour self-service capabilities, reusable solutions, automation, and measurable, gradual improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We share knowledge and treat reliability, security, quality, and developer experience as shared responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You&#39;ll Be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role based in Amsterdam.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;You will work from our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam HQ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is open to candidates worldwide. For selected candidates, Catawiki &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;can provide visa sponsorship and relocation support to the relevant location&lt;/span&gt;, subject to eligibility and applicable restrictions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;800+ Catawikians&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/span&gt; depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work From Home&lt;/span&gt; Allowance to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commuting&lt;/span&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Office&lt;/span&gt; right in the centre of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an SMB Account Executive you will be responsible for owning the full sales cycle for small and medium-sized customers, from opportunity qualification through close and initial onboarding. This role focuses on velocity, disciplined execution. You will generate your own pipeline and will manage the inbound (marketing generated) opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline &amp;amp; Opportunity Ownership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle for SMB customers, from qualified opportunity through close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a healthy pipeline through self-prospecting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize opportunities based on fit, urgency, and likelihood to close within defined sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate opportunity management and forecasting in Salesforce (SFDC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer Discovery &amp;amp; Solution Selling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with SMB customers to understand their business objectives, supply chain needs, and operational constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer needs into clear, value-driven Flexport solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate Flexport’s platform and services through structured discovery calls, remote meetings, and tailored demos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulate pricing, value, and next steps to move opportunities forward efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Closing &amp;amp; Onboarding&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead commercial negotiations and close new business in line with revenue and volume targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer onboarding and handoff by coordinating with Operations/Account Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations with customers on scope, timelines, and success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure early customer success by staying engaged during initial execution phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prerequisites:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ months experience as an SDR or 12+ months of sales experience in a previous role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage multiple opportunities concurrently in a structured sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills, with confidence engaging customers by phone and video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-first mindset with a bias toward execution and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity and willingness to learn a complex industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; additional local language skills preferred depending on region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you receive back:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunches incl. vegetarian options, breakfast, snacks and soft drinks available in our office on daily basis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commute expenses: Flexport will cover&amp;nbsp; home-office commuting costs for employees living outside of Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing office in the heart of Amsterdam.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days as vacation days based on full time employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: Flexport offers a collective health insurance plan including a basic package and any available additional packages. Your monthly premium is fully paid by Flexport.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined pension contribution scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
